<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Packer Docker Web Server</title>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f0f4f8;
      color: #1a202c;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 24px;
    }
    .card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      padding: 36px 40px;
      max-width: 680px;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #d1fae5;
      color: #065f46;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }
    h1 { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    p  { color: #4a5568; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
    ul li {
      padding: 10px 14px;
      background: #f7fafc;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-size: 14px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    ul li::before { content: "✓"; color: #38a169; font-weight: bold; }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 24px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #a0aec0;
    }
    code {
      background: #edf2f7;
      padding: 2px 6px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 12px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="badge">HEALTHY</div>
    <h1>Packer-built Apache + Python Container</h1>
    <p>This Docker image was created with HashiCorp Packer and provisioned using Ansible playbooks. All tools are baked in and ready.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Apache 2 installed and running on port 80</li>
      <li>Python 3 + pip + Flask + Gunicorn installed</li>
      <li>Security headers applied via Apache modules</li>
      <li>ServerTokens set to Prod (version hidden)</li>
      <li>TraceEnable Off (XST protection)</li>
      <li>All security patches applied at build time</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="footer">
      Built with Packer &bull; Provisioned by Ansible &bull; Image date: <code>{{ ansible_date_time.date if ansible_date_time is defined else 'see label' }}</code>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
